---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Support the Server" description="Help keep the Farm Nerds Plex server running." section="support">
  <div class="stack">
    <div class="pagehead"><span class="chip">Support</span><h1>Support the Server</h1></div>
    <div class="md">
      <p>Every contribution helps keep the Farm Nerds Plex server (JD's Plex Server) running strong, from upgrading hard drives, expanding storage, and boosting performance inside the 'Farmlab' itself.</p>
      <p>Whether you want to make a one-time contribution or support monthly, everything helps keep the farm nerd magic cooking.</p>
      <p>Either of the options below should let you click to choose the donation support amount that you deem appropriate. You may choose a one time, a monthly recurring, or a one time yearly recurring. Again, your choice. Later on we may add a subscription tier for newer members but everyone that sees this message is grandfathered in to you choosing the amount you give, and being a part of what continues to help maintain this service.</p>
      <p>I sincerely Thank You from the deepest part of my heart. This has been a long project of mine as some of you may know and have been a part of from day 1.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=QWK366WDFQ9KJ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate Support with PayPal</a>
      <a class="btn alt" href="https://donate.stripe.com/cNi7sLb9EbAL5O1cO8asg00" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate Support with Stripe</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
